{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[Intro: A$AP Ferg]\n[00:23.70] Kirk Kneezy on the beat, yeah!\n[Chorus]\n[00:25.16] Demon girl, how come you hold me close?\n[00:28.56] I like it, don't let go\n[00:31.38] You are my overdose\n[00:34.46] In the underworld, we roam (Roam) -oam (Roam) -oam (Roam) -oam (Roam) -oam (Roam)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:47.92] I was gettin' my heart broke, now I'm the heartbreaker\n[00:51.94] She be drawin' pentagrams, she a soul-taker\n[00:54.96] When she took me to her room, all I saw was three six\n[00:58.12] I know that's what heartbreak is made of\n[01:00.98] Three 9 on my wrist, bitch, Hell upside\n[01:03.98] Cupid tryna kill you, I'm in the crossfire\n[01:06.98] Demons come in handy like a spare tire\n[01:09.98] They put my life on the wire\n[01:12.60] Yeah, I'm gettin' higher and higher\n[01:15.20] Pill pop shorty, I do not need a lighter\n[01:18.26] Heart stop shorty, I'ma go out flyin'\n[01:21.20] Let me stop playin', bitch, I already died\n[Chorus]\n[01:24.66] Demon girl, how come you hold me close?\n[01:28.56] I like it, don't let go\n[01:31.38] You are my overdose\n[01:34.40] In the underworld, we roam (Roam)\n[01:36.08] -oam (Roam)\n[01:44.14] -oam (Roam)\n[01:44.46] -oam (Roam)\n[01:44.80] -oam (Roam)\n[Verse 2]\n[01:48.98] Here we go\n[01:50.54] It was all heaven just a week ago\n[01:53.46] Now I'm up in Hell with my eyes closed\n[01:56.48] Gettin' sucked up by a devil ho\n[01:59.48] Takin' these pills on an empty stomach\n[02:01.98] Is like gettin' fucked up with the devil, ho\n[02:05.46] Fuck her to my favorite heavy metal, ho\n[02:08.48] We know all the words, so it's special\n[02:10.68] So, so special\n[02:12.28] I loved her and let her go (Go, go, go), fuck that\n[02:15.22] Maybe I'ma hold her close, get the fuck back\n[02:18.26] I'm about to overdose, and she love that\n[02:21.14] Story of a demon seducin' a young drug head\n[Chorus]\n[02:24.60] Demon girl, how come you hold me close?\n[02:28.54] I like it, don't let go\n[02:31.38] You are my overdose\n[02:34.60] In the underworld, we roam (Roam) -oam (Roam) -oam (Roam) -oam (Roam) -oam (Roam)\n[Verse 3]\n[02:49.34] Never knew her, but I wish I did (Phew)\n[02:53.80] I never missed that bitch, act like I ain't never hit that bitch\n[02:59.08] Get it poppin' like a zit little bitch\n[03:02.04] Talk it but I live it, Lamborghini I remember civics\n[03:07.70] Niggas really wasn't actin' civil\n[03:10.76] All my niggas they do forgiveness\n[03:13.68] Kill you then they aimin' at a witness\n[03:15.80] But we ain't never shootin' at the children\n[03:18.76] Bitch you see how I'm livin', tryna get the car with the stars in the ceilin'\n[03:24.26] I could fuck your broad off a bar and a Xann\n[03:26.82] Bitch you see how I'm livin', tryna get the car with the stars in the ceilin'\n[03:31.78] I could fuck your broad off a bar and a Xan\n[03:35.46] Shit been gettin' violent, bloody wrist, I fight it\n[03:41.50] My gun got a silence, I don't got no time\n[03:47.52] Demons, I'm gon' fight it, slit my wrist in silence\n[03:53.84] Pop a perky got me hearin' shit (Phew)\n[03:57.60] Got me hearin' shit, I was on some incoherent shit (Yuh, phew)\n[04:03.82] Incoherent shit, took a check to the dealership\n[04:08.50] Pull up in that shit like John Dillinger (Phew)\n[04:12.34] I feel like a Pilgrim (Phew)\n[04:15.24] Nigga you a Indian (Yuh)\n[04:18.22] Welcome to my Pilgrimage\n[04:19.80] I be pillaging, I be killin' with my niggas\n[04:22.34] Blowin' like a ceiling fan, pop you like a wheelie\n[04:25.12] I ain't talkin' about Meek Milly\n[04:26.84] Serve a couple milli', now I got a couple milli'\n[04:29.46] I don't got no time for the thrills, it's all about the thousand dollar bills\n[04:35.60] I know that the hate is for real, yeah\n[04:41.58] I don't got no time for the thrills, I know that the hate is for real\n[04:46.54] It's all about the dollars, dollar bills\n[04:49.80] And I got the choppa, how you feel\n[04:52.88] We don't want no problems, bitch for real\n[04:55.86] I feel like a goblin off a bill\n[04:58.90] Today I almost OD'd, couldn't breathe I was tryna go to sleep (Phew)\n[05:05.10] Niggas claim they know me, in these streets they don't know me\n[05:09.94] Fuck your bitch, they don't wanna leave they follow\n[05:14.58] I might not let her see tomorrow, xanny put me out of my sorrows\n[05:20.44] They don't wanna leave they follow, ball like a floater\n[05:25.00] You're an imposer, you're just a poser\n[05:28.02] I'm a composer, I'm just keepin' composure\n[05:30.58] That's your girlfriend why is she on my phone, she won't leave me alone\n[05:37.36] Leave a message at the tone, fuck up your happy ho-ome\n[05:45.28] Ho-ome, ho-ome, ho-ome\n[05:52.40] In the underworld, I roam\n[05:55.32] Ring-ring, pick up my phone\n[05:58.34] Leave a message at the tone, my sins I won't atone\n[06:05.48] Watch the throne, fuck your ho with my eyes closed\n[06:14.20] I get high for all my lows, Illuminati tryna take my soul\n[06:20.22] 3 million better pay it in gold, lean too much\n[06:25.04] I know I wanna die now, fuck that\n[06:27.80] If you ain't gettin' money get the fuck back\n[06:30.22] When your ho come over, we gon’ take her phone\n[06:36.18] Fuck me on a pentagram, she a soul taker\n[06:38.88] Layin' down in her room, on her walls\n[06:40.98] Now I got her soul on fire\n[06:42.60] Here we go, demon girls got me on the roll\n[06:46.48] I was supposed to hit her once and let her go\n[06:48.60] Percocet the holy ghost (Where the drugs at?)\n[06:51.02] Money count so big, these the average jig\n[06:53.54] Act like I ain't knew ya\n[06:55.00] That bitch from Japan so I fucked her in Shibuya\n[Chorus]\n[07:00.58] Demon girl, how come you hold me close?\n[07:04.56] I like it, don't let go\n[07:07.38] You are my overdose\n[07:10.38] In the underworld, we roam (Roam) -oam (Roam) -oam (Roam) -oam (Roam) -oam (Roam)","words":[[0.0,8.26,"[00:00.00]"],[22.32,22.72,"[Instrumental"],[22.8,22.92,"Intro]"],[22.98,23.